# HorizontalBarChart

## Overview

A complete horizontal bar chart component that composes ChartHeader, ChartLegend, DataDisplay, HorizontalBarGroup, and ChartFooter. Uses D3 for data scaling; all styling comes from the CSS token cascade (`--DataVis-Categorical-Bold-{n}` via `generateDataVisCSS`, surface/typography tokens via `useBrandCSSNew`, both injected at `@layer brand`) — there is no runtime JS token resolver and no `modes` prop.

**This component follows the [Organized Props Pattern](./OrganizedPropsPattern.md).**

## Figma Reference

- **Node ID**: `138:10008`
- **Design File**: DataVis-Components
- **Figma URL**: https://www.figma.com/design/uA5ExvS0cNXbDEKzT9Rnrt/DataVis-Components?node-id=138-10008

## Architecture

```
HorizontalBarChart (flex column, gap: Dimensions/Spacings/5)
├── ChartHeader (optional, chartHeader &&)
│   ├── ChartTitle
│   └── ChartSubtitle
├── ChartLegend (optional, chartLegend &&)
│   └── ChartKey[] (with optional DataHead)
├── DataDisplay (optional, dataDisplay &&)
│   ├── contentLeft
│   │   ├── mainLabel (inline typography + optional InfoIcon)
│   │   └── DataHead (DataLead + SupportingData + SupportingLabel)
│   └── contentRight (DataBadgeSemantic)
├── HorizontalBarGroup (flex: 1)
│   ├── contentWrapper (contains bars, measured for hit area)
│   │   └── HorizontalBar[] (for each data point)
│   │       ├── hitArea (transparent overlay, extends between bars)
│   │       ├── categoryLabelOutside
│   │       ├── barArea
│   │       │   ├── barWrapper (proportional width)
│   │       │   └── rightOutsideLabel
│   │       └── XAxis (optional)
└── ChartFooter (optional, chartFooter &&)
    ├── annotationLeft
    └── annotationRight
```

## Canonical Default Render

> **This is what consumers should get when they request a `HorizontalBarChart` without supplying extra detail.** It is the spec: the `Default` story in `HorizontalBarChart.stories.tsx` matches this exactly, and any future change to the canonical baseline must update the story, this section, and the meta `docs.description` together.

### What's ON by default

| Part                                  | Default                 | Why                                                                                                                  |
| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `ChartHeader`                         | **ON**                  | Title + subtitle anchor the chart so the reader knows what they're looking at                                        |
| `barGroupConfig.categoryLabelOutside` | **ON**                  | Category labels sit in the left gutter — the horizontal layout's main strength: long labels have room                |
| `barGroupConfig.rightLabelOutside`    | **ON**                  | Value labels sit to the right of each bar, so the value is legible without needing the X-axis                        |
| `barGroupConfig.xAxis`                | **ON**                  | Quantitative reference for the bar values; ticks share the bar group's D3 scale                                      |
| `barGroupConfig.hoverBadge`           | **ON**                  | Cursor-following `DataBadge` for per-bar value reveal — same UX consumers expect from the vertical-bar chart default |
| `ChartFooter`                         | **ON**                  | Slot for source / footnote annotations                                                                               |
| `interactive`                         | **ON** (default `true`) | Bars receive hover / click / focus handlers                                                                          |
| `barGroupConfig.barHeight`            | **`"M"`**               | Default bar thickness (cross-axis)                                                                                   |

### What's OFF by default (opt-in only)

| Part                                              | When to enable                                                                                                                                                                            |
| ------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `chartLegend`                                     | Single-series horizontal charts don't need a per-bar colour key (category labels already identify each row); turn on when the chart sits next to a DataHead KPI or shares series identity |
| `dataDisplay`                                     | Only when the chart is paired with a primary KPI / summary surface that benefits from a static or hover-driven `DataDisplay` block above the bars                                         |
| `barGroupConfig.rightLabelInside`                 | Dashboard cards with no left gutter — value floats over the bar fill at the right edge                                                                                                    |
| `barGroupConfig.categoryLabelInside`              | Bars label themselves when there's no left gutter; pair with a wider `barHeight` so the text stays legible                                                                                |
| `animated`                                        | Datasets that change at runtime (filters, scenario toggles)                                                                                                                               |
| `valueFormat` / `dataSort`                        | Domain-specific formatting / sorting needs                                                                                                                                                |
| `categoryLabelMaxLines` / `categoryLabelMaxWidth` | Very long category names that need word-wrap or a fixed-width gutter                                                                                                                      |
| `overflowType: "all"`                             | Long datasets where every datapoint must remain visible (per-bar slot collapses below the resolved `barHeight`); leave default `"truncated"` for fixed surfaces                           |
| `accessibility.enabled`                           | Production charts (always opt in for shipped charts; off in this default for the rendered Storybook demo)                                                                                 |

### Minimal canonical example

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={canonicalData}
  chartHeader
  chartFooter
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Monthly revenue.",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Q1-Q2 2024 performance overview.",
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    categoryLabelOutside: true,
    rightLabelOutside: true,
    xAxis: true,
    barHeight: "M",
    hoverBadge: true,
  }}
  chartFooterConfig={{
    annotationLeftValue: 'Source: Internal Analytics.',
    annotationRightValue: '*In thousands USD.',
  }}
/>
```

> **Authoring rule:** when a consumer (human or LLM) asks for "a HorizontalBarChart" without further detail, render the example above — _not_ the `Anatomy` story (everything turned on at once). Anatomy exists as a reference; the default is what ships in real product surfaces.

## Import

```tsx
import { HorizontalBarChart } from './charts/HorizontalBarChart';
```

## Data Formats

### ChartDataPoint (Canonical - Recommended)

```tsx
import { ChartDataPoint } from "../types/chart-data";

interface ChartDataPoint {
  id?: string; // Unique identifier for React keys
  category: CategoryValue; // Category label (e.g., "Category A")
  value: number; // Numeric value for bar width
  color?: string; // Optional custom color for the bar
  colorIndex?: number; // Categorical color index (1-6)
}
```

### HorizontalDataPoint (Legacy - Deprecated)

```tsx
/**
 * @deprecated Use ChartDataPoint from '../types/chart-data' instead.
 */
interface HorizontalDataPoint {
  label: string; // Category label
  value: number; // Numeric value for bar width
  color?: string; // Optional custom color
}
```

## Props Interface (Organized Props Pattern)

```typescript
/** Props for the ChartHeader child component */
type ChartHeaderConfig = Pick<
  ChartHeaderProps,
  "chartTitleValue" | "chartSubtitleValue" | "title" | "subtitle" | "titleId" | "subtitleId"
>;

/** Props for the ChartLegend child component */
interface ChartLegendConfig {
  items?: ChartLegendItem[];
  categoryLabelValue?: string;
  type?: "circle" | "dashed" | "line";
  dataHead?: boolean;
  dataHeadConfig?: {
    dataLeadValue?: number | string;
    dataSupportingValue?: number | string;
    supportingLabelValue?: string;
    supportingData?: boolean;
    supportingLabel?: boolean;
  };
  /** Typography size variant. Controls legend item scaling. */
  size?: "XS" | "S" | "M" | "L" | "XL";
  /** Forwarded to ChartLegend's aria-label. */
  ariaLabel?: string;
  /** Forwarded to ChartLegend's aria-labelledby; takes precedence over ariaLabel when set. */
  ariaLabelledBy?: string;
}

/** Props for the HorizontalBarGroup child component */
interface BarGroupConfig {
  type?: "onlyPositives" | "withNegatives";
  rightLabelOutside?: boolean;
  rightLabelInside?: boolean;
  categoryLabelOutside?: boolean;
  categoryLabelInside?: boolean;
  xAxis?: boolean;
  valueFormat?: ValueFormatConfig;
  barHeight?: string;
  hoverBadge?: boolean;
  onBarHover?: (data: HorizontalBarHoverData) => void;
  onBarClick?: (data: HorizontalBarHoverData) => void;
  /** Back-compat alias for `highlightedBarIndices`. */
  hoveredBarIndex?: number | number[];
  /** Indices of bars rendered at full opacity; every other bar dims. */
  highlightedBarIndices?: number[];
  xAxisConfig?: XAxisConfig;
  hoverBadgeConfig?: HoverBadgeConfig;
  dataSort?: DataSortOrder;
  /** Label column width: pixel number overrides auto-measurement, 'auto' adapts based on categoryLabelMaxLines (default: 'auto') */
  categoryLabelMaxWidth?: number | "auto";
  /** Maximum number of text lines per category label (default: 1) */
  categoryLabelMaxLines?: number;
  overflowType?: "truncated" | "all";
}

/** Nested config for X-axis customisation */
interface XAxisConfig {
  tickCount?: number;
  formatValue?: (value: number) => string;
}

/** Nested config for hover badge customisation */
interface HoverBadgeConfig {
  formatValue?: (value: number, label?: string) => string;
  formatBadge?: (value: number, label?: string, secondaryValue?: number) => DataBadgeConfig;
}

/** Props for the ChartFooter child component */
type ChartFooterConfig = Pick<
  ChartFooterProps,
  "annotationLeft" | "annotationLeftValue" | "annotationRight" | "annotationRightValue"
>;

/**
 * Props for the DataDisplay child component.
 * Mirrors DataDisplayProps structure (Layer 2 + Layer 3), with additional
 * chart-specific props for hover behaviour.
 * When mode is "hover", mainLabelValue, dataHead.dataLeadValue, and
 * badgeConfig.value update dynamically on hover.
 */
interface DataDisplayConfig {
  // --- Chart-specific behaviour ---
  mode?: "static" | "hover";
  formatHoverLeadValue?: (value: number, category?: CategoryValue) => string;
  formatHoverBadgeValue?: (value: number, category?: CategoryValue) => string;

  // --- DataDisplay Layer 2 props ---
  mainLabelValue?: string;
  alignment?: "Left" | "Center";
  rightBadgeWrapper?: boolean;
  badgeTop?: boolean;
  badgeBottom?: boolean;
  showBadge?: boolean;
  supportingBadgeLabel?: boolean;
  supportingBadgeLabelValue?: string;
  size?: 'XS' | 'S' | 'M' | 'L' | 'XL';

  // --- DataDisplay Layer 3 configs ---
  dataHead?: DataHeadConfig;
  badgeConfig?: BadgeConfig;
}

export interface HorizontalBarChartProps {
  // Layer 2: Parent component props
  /**
   * Supports canonical format (ChartDataPoint[]) or legacy format (HorizontalDataPoint[])
   */
  data: ChartDataPoint[] | HorizontalDataPoint[];
  width?: number | string;
  height?: number | string;
  chartHeader?: boolean;
  chartFooter?: boolean;
  chartLegend?: boolean;
  dataDisplay?: boolean;
  /** Enable hover/click interactivity on bars (default: true) */
  interactive?: boolean;
  /** Enable entry animation where bars grow from left to right on first load (default: false) */
  animated?: boolean;
  /** When true, chart fills 100% of its parent container width */
  fullWidth?: boolean;
  /** Auto-collapse the chart container's height to fit its content instead of stretching to `height` (default: false) */
  autoHeight?: boolean;

  // Layer 3: Child component configurations (Config suffix)
  chartHeaderConfig?: ChartHeaderConfig;
  chartLegendConfig?: ChartLegendConfig;
  dataDisplayConfig?: DataDisplayConfig;
  barGroupConfig?: BarGroupConfig;
  chartFooterConfig?: ChartFooterConfig;

  accessibility?: AccessibilityConfig;
}
```

## Props

### Parent Component Props (Layer 2)

| Prop          | Type                                        | Default | Description                                                              |
| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `data`        | `ChartDataPoint[] \| HorizontalDataPoint[]` | `[]`    | Array of data points (canonical or legacy format)                        |
| `width`       | `number \| string`                          | `346`   | Total width of the chart container                                       |
| `height`      | `number \| string`                          | `400`   | **Total height of the chart.** HorizontalBarGroup fills remaining space. |
| `chartHeader` | `boolean`                                   | `true`  | Show the chart header (title + subtitle)                                 |
| `chartFooter` | `boolean`                                   | `true`  | Show the chart footer (annotations)                                      |
| `chartLegend` | `boolean`                                   | `false` | Show the chart legend                                                    |
| `dataDisplay` | `boolean`                                   | `false` | Show DataDisplay component above the bar group                           |
| `interactive` | `boolean`                                   | `true`  | Enable hover/click interactivity on bars                                 |
| `animated`    | `boolean`                                   | `false` | Enable entry animation where bars grow from left to right on first load  |
| `fullWidth`   | `boolean`                                   | `false` | Stretch chart to fill its parent container width                         |
| `autoHeight`  | `boolean`                                   | `false` | Auto-collapse the chart container's height to fit its content (header + legend + dataDisplay + bars + X-axis + footer) instead of stretching to `height`. See [Auto-Collapse for Sparse Data](#auto-collapse-for-sparse-data-autoheight) |

### ChartHeader Config (`chartHeaderConfig`)

| Prop                 | Type      | Default     | Description                                                                                  |
| -------------------- | --------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `chartTitleValue`    | `string`  | `undefined` | Chart title text                                                                              |
| `chartSubtitleValue` | `string`  | `undefined` | Chart subtitle text                                                                           |
| `title`              | `boolean` | `true`      | Show the title                                                                                |
| `subtitle`           | `boolean` | `true`      | Show the subtitle                                                                             |
| `titleId`            | `string`  | `undefined` | DOM id forwarded to the rendered title element; wired to accessibility's `aria-labelledby`    |
| `subtitleId`         | `string`  | `undefined` | DOM id forwarded to the rendered subtitle element; wired to accessibility's `aria-describedby` |

### ChartLegend Config (`chartLegendConfig`)

| Prop                 | Type                             | Default     | Description                                      |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `items`              | `ChartLegendItem[]`              | `undefined` | Manual legend items - overrides auto-generation  |
| `categoryLabelValue` | `string`                         | `undefined` | Simple legend label for single-series charts     |
| `type`               | `"circle" \| "dashed" \| "line"` | `"circle"`  | Indicator type for legend                        |
| `dataHead`           | `boolean`                        | `false`     | Show DataHead in legend                          |
| `dataHeadConfig`     | `object`                         | `undefined` | Configuration for DataHead (see sub-table below) |
| `size`               | `"XS" \| "S" \| "M" \| "L" \| "XL"` | `undefined` | Typography size variant controlling legend item scaling |
| `ariaLabel`          | `string`                         | `"Chart legend"` | Forwarded to ChartLegend's `aria-label`         |
| `ariaLabelledBy`     | `string`                         | `undefined` | Forwarded to ChartLegend's `aria-labelledby`; takes precedence over `ariaLabel` when set |

#### `dataHeadConfig` (nested inside `chartLegendConfig`)

| Prop                  | Type               | Default     | Description                              |
| --------------------- | ------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `dataLeadValue`       | `number \| string` | `undefined` | Lead value for DataHead (e.g., "₹2,390") |
| `dataSupportingValue` | `number \| string` | `undefined` | Supporting value (e.g., "/ 3,000")       |
| `supportingLabelValue` | `string`           | `undefined` | Supporting label text for DataHead       |
| `supportingData`      | `boolean`          | `true`      | Show SupportingData in DataHead          |
| `supportingLabel`     | `boolean`          | `true`      | Show SupportingLabel in DataHead         |

### BarGroup Config (`barGroupConfig`)

| Prop                    | Type                                     | Default       | Description                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `type`                  | `"onlyPositives" \| "withNegatives"`     | auto-detect   | Chart data type. Auto-detected from data when omitted                                                                                                                                               |
| `rightLabelOutside`     | `boolean`                                | `true`        | Show value labels outside the bar on the right                                                                                                                                                      |
| `rightLabelInside`      | `boolean`                                | `false`       | Show value labels inside the bar on the right                                                                                                                                                       |
| `categoryLabelOutside`  | `boolean`                                | `true`        | Show category labels outside the bar on the left                                                                                                                                                    |
| `categoryLabelInside`   | `boolean`                                | `false`       | Show category labels inside the bar on the left                                                                                                                                                     |
| `xAxis`                 | `boolean`                                | `true`        | Show the X-axis at the bottom                                                                                                                                                                       |
| `valueFormat`           | `ValueFormatConfig`                      | `undefined`   | Value format configuration for axis and labels                                                                                                                                                      |
| `barHeight`             | `string`                                 | `"M"`         | T-shirt sizing: `"XS"`, `"S"`, `"M"`, `"L"`, `"XL"`, `"2XL"`                                                                                                                                        |
| `hoverBadge`            | `boolean`                                | `false`       | Show DataBadge that follows cursor when hovering bars                                                                                                                                               |
| `onBarHover`            | `(data: HorizontalBarHoverData) => void` | `undefined`   | Callback fired when any bar hover state changes                                                                                                                                                     |
| `onBarClick`            | `(data: HorizontalBarHoverData) => void` | `undefined`   | Callback fired when any bar is clicked                                                                                                                                                              |
| `highlightedBarIndices` | `number[]`                               | `undefined`   | Indices of bars rendered at full opacity; every other bar dims (multi-bar highlight)                                                                                                                |
| `hoveredBarIndex`       | `number \| number[]`                     | `undefined`   | Back-compat alias for `highlightedBarIndices`. Accepts single index or array                                                                                                                        |
| `xAxisConfig`           | `XAxisConfig`                            | `undefined`   | Nested config for X-axis customisation (see sub-table below)                                                                                                                                        |
| `hoverBadgeConfig`      | `HoverBadgeConfig`                       | `undefined`   | Nested config for hover badge formatting (see sub-table below)                                                                                                                                      |
| `dataSort`              | `DataSortOrder`                          | `"unsorted"`  | Sort bars by value: `"asc"`, `"desc"`, or `"unsorted"`                                                                                                                                              |
| `categoryLabelMaxWidth` | `number \| "auto"`                       | `"auto"`      | Label column width: a pixel number overrides auto-measurement, `"auto"` adapts based on `categoryLabelMaxLines`                                                                                     |
| `categoryLabelMaxLines` | `number`                                 | `1`           | Maximum number of text lines per category label; excess lines truncated with ellipsis via CSS line-clamp                                                                                            |
| `overflowType`          | `"truncated" \| "all"`                   | `"truncated"` | Overflow handling when bars exceed available height. `"truncated"`: bars that don't fit (gap < barHeight) are removed from the bottom. `"all"`: every bar is rendered regardless of available space |

#### `xAxisConfig` (nested inside `barGroupConfig`)

| Prop              | Type                        | Default         | Description                       |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- | --------------- | --------------------------------- |
| `tickCount`       | `number`                    | `6`             | Target number of X-axis ticks     |
| `formatValue`     | `(value: number) => string` | `undefined`     | Custom formatter for tick labels  |
| `xAxisLabel`      | `boolean`                   | `false`         | Show label below tick marks       |
| `xAxisLabelValue` | `string`                    | `"xAxis label"` | Text content for the X-axis label |

#### `hoverBadgeConfig` (nested inside `barGroupConfig`)

| Prop          | Type                                                 | Default     | Description                                                               |
| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `formatValue` | `(value: number, label?: string) => string`                              | `undefined` | Custom formatter for hover badge value                                    |
| `formatBadge` | `(value: number, label?: string, secondaryValue?: number) => DataBadgeConfig` | `undefined` | Structured formatter returning `DataBadgeConfig` for multi-section badges |

### ChartFooter Config (`chartFooterConfig`)

| Prop                   | Type      | Default     | Description                          |
| ---------------------- | --------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------- |
| `annotationLeft`       | `boolean` | `true`      | Toggle visibility of the left annotation |
| `annotationLeftValue`  | `string`  | `undefined` | Left annotation text (e.g., source)  |
| `annotationRight`      | `boolean` | `true`      | Toggle visibility of the right annotation |
| `annotationRightValue` | `string`  | `undefined` | Right annotation text (e.g., notes)  |

### DataDisplay Config (`dataDisplayConfig`)

`dataDisplayConfig` uses the **Mirror Pattern** — it mirrors `DataDisplayProps` (Layer 2 + Layer 3) and adds chart-specific hover behaviour on top. The chart forwards every Layer 3 slot (`dataHead`, `dataBadgeSemanticConfig`) straight to DataDisplay.

#### Chart-specific behaviour

| Prop                    | Type                                                  | Default     | Description                                                                                                                                               |
| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mode`                  | `"static" \| "hover"`                                 | `"static"`  | Display mode. `"hover"` updates `mainLabelValue`, `dataHead.dataLeadValue`, and `dataBadgeSemanticConfig.dataBadgeSemanticValue` dynamically on bar hover |
| `formatHoverLeadValue`  | `(value: number, category?: CategoryValue) => string` | `undefined` | Custom formatter for lead value in hover mode                                                                                                             |
| `formatHoverBadgeValue` | `(value: number, category?: CategoryValue) => string` | `undefined` | Custom formatter for badge value in hover mode                                                                                                            |

#### DataDisplay Layer 2 props (mirrored)

| Prop                       | Type                 | Default  | Description                                                       |
| -------------------------- | -------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `mainLabelValue`           | `string`             | `"Label."` | Main label text above the DataHead value (DataDisplay's own default when unset) |
| `alignment`                | `"Left" \| "Center"` | `"Left"` | Layout alignment: `"Left"` horizontal, `"Center"` vertical stacked |
| `rightBadgeWrapper` | `boolean`            | `true`   | Visibility of the rightBadgeWrapper section (right column) |
| `badgeTop`                 | `boolean`            | `false`  | Visibility of the badgeTop slot                                   |
| `badgeBottom`              | `boolean`            | `true`   | Visibility of the badgeBottom slot                                |
| `showBadge`                | `boolean`                         | `true`   | Visibility of all badge instances                                 |
| `supportingBadgeLabel`     | `boolean`                         | `true`   | Visibility of the supporting label next to the badge              |
| `supportingBadgeLabelValue`     | `string`                          | `"Than last month."` | Supporting label text next to the badge (DataDisplay's own default when unset) |
| `size`                | `"XS" \| "S" \| "M" \| "L" \| "XL"` | `"L"`    | Local size variant for typography scaling                         |

#### DataDisplay Layer 3 configs (forwarded)

| Prop          | Type             | Default | Description                                                       |
| ------------- | ---------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `dataHead`    | `DataHeadConfig` | `{}`    | Configuration for the DataHead child component                    |
| `badgeConfig` | `BadgeConfig`    | `{}`    | Configuration for the badge — `value` updates dynamically on hover |

## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage (Organized Props)

```tsx
import { HorizontalBarChart } from './charts/HorizontalBarChart';

const data = [
  { category: 'Category A', value: 120 },
  { category: 'Category B', value: 85 },
  { category: 'Category C', value: 150 },
];

<HorizontalBarChart data={data} />;
```

### Full Configuration

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={data}
  width={400}
  height={350}
  chartHeader={true}
  chartFooter={true}
  chartLegend={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: 'Revenue by Category',
    chartSubtitleValue: 'Q4 2025 performance data.',
  }}
  chartLegendConfig={{
    categoryLabelValue: 'Revenue',
  }}
  barGroupConfig={{
    rightLabelOutside: true,
    categoryLabelOutside: true,
    xAxis: true,
    barHeight: 'M',
  }}
  chartFooterConfig={{
    annotationLeftValue: 'Source: Finance.',
    annotationRightValue: 'Values in thousands.',
  }}
/>;
```

### With Legend and DataHead

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={data}
  chartLegend={true}
  chartLegendConfig={{
    categoryLabelValue: 'Total Revenue',
    dataHead: true,
    dataHeadConfig: {
      dataLeadValue: '₹8.5L',
      dataSupportingValue: '/ 10L',
      supportingLabelValue: 'target',
      supportingData: true,
      supportingLabel: true,
    },
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay (Static Mode)

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: "Revenue by Category",
    chartSubtitleValue: "Q4 2025 performance",
  }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: 'static',
    mainLabelValue: 'Total revenue',
    dataHead: {
      dataLeadValue: '£2,390',
      dataSupportingValue: '/ 3,000',
      supportingLabelValue: 'Monthly target',
      supportingLabel: true,
    },
    badgeConfig: {
      value: '+23.5%',
    },
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay (Hover Mode)

DataDisplay updates dynamically when hovering over bars — `mainLabelValue`, `dataHead.dataLeadValue`, and `badgeConfig.value` are overwritten from the hovered data point:

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  interactive={true}
  chartHeaderConfig={{
    chartTitleValue: 'Revenue by Category',
  }}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: 'hover',
    mainLabelValue: 'Hover a bar to see details',
    dataHead: {
      dataLeadValue: '-',
      supportingData: false,
    },
    badgeConfig: {
      value: '-',
    },
  }}
/>
```

### With DataDisplay (Hover Mode + Custom Formatters)

```tsx
<HorizontalBarChart
  data={data}
  dataDisplay={true}
  interactive={true}
  dataDisplayConfig={{
    mode: "hover",
    mainLabelValue: "Select a category",
    formatHoverLeadValue: (value, category) => `${category}: £${value.toLocaleString()}`,
    formatHoverBadgeValue: (value) => {
      const percent = ((value / totalRevenue) * 100).toFixed(1);
      return `${percent}%`;
    },
  }}
/>
```

